+    // PS2X_VU1_ASYNC_QUEUE=1 (sw-dips4): the worker posts an MSCAL / MSCNT as the next job while the previous program
+    // still runs (m_vu1AsyncNextState 1) and waits until the VU1 thread took it (0): that thread starts it the moment the
+    // previous program ends, without a hand-off back to the worker. The worker leaves the MSCAL at the same point as
